<title>USA: Genus names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Genus names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, California 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genus Inc has named John Aldeborgh chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, Aldeborgh was executive vice-president and general manager of the company's Ion Technology Products in Newburyport, Massachusetts. He joined Genus in 1989 as director of operations.</p>
<p>Genus develops, manufactures, markets and services advanced thin-film deposition and high-energy ion implantation equipment used in the fabrication of advanced semiconductor devices.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
